From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:29:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual yanking so focused panes copy
 selections with Vim keys

Support character, line, and block selections over the focused terminal pane and emit OSC 52 clipboard output on yank so users can copy visible Work Leaf text without leaving the keyboard-driven terminal flow.
